<title>NETHERLANDS: ING Barings cuts Oce to a Hold.</title>
<headline>ING Barings cuts Oce to a Hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Oct 17 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price-------Broker------------</p>
<p>Oce-vd Grinten  copier maker  194.50	ING Barings</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold (from Buy)</p>
<p>Operating margin Q3 below expectations. Based on our doubts about operating margin developments we lower our estimates. Shares now fully valued. We do not see much potential for outperformance in the coming year. Price target maintained at 210 guilders and recommendation downgraded to Hold from Buy.  </p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs</p>
<p>    1996		   8.50     (8.80)</p>
<p>    1997		  10.90    (11.35)</p>
<p>    1998		  12.80    (13.10)</p>
